# 🚀 Terraform Docker IaC Project

## 📌 Overview
This project demonstrates **Infrastructure as Code (IaC)** using **Terraform** to provision a local **Docker container**.

## 🛠 Tools Used
- Terraform
- Docker
- Docker Provider

## 🎯 Objective
Provision an nginx container using Terraform.

## ⚙️ What Terraform Does
✅ Pulls nginx image  
✅ Creates Docker container  
✅ Exposes localhost:8080  

## 🚀 Execution Steps

Initialize Terraform:
```bash
terraform init

Preview changes:

terraform plan

Apply infrastructure:

terraform apply

Destroy infrastructure:

terraform destroy
📊 Outcome

✔ Learned Terraform workflow
✔ Understood IaC lifecycle
✔ Provisioned Docker resources declaratively

